cy, and most importantly, AUC\n\n4. **Physics Relevance**:\n   - The feature engineering is grounded in particle physics understanding:\n     - Used delta_R to capture angular separation between particles (critical for identifying decay products)\n     - Incorporated object counts and kinematic distributions that differentiate signal (four top quarks) from background\n     - Leveraged ratios of energies and momenta that are indicative of specific decay chains\n\nThis solution prioritizes the AUC metric by implementing a custom model that learns from physics-inspired features while employing techniques like residual connections, batch normalization, and appropriate regularization to maximize discrimination power between signal and background events."
